SUMMARY:Ellen Rowe’s All About the Trio: The Genius of Dave Brubeck
DESCRIPTION:Buy Tickets!\n			\n				Buy a Series Subscription!* (10% Discount)\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				*Buy a subscription with tickets to all four of the Ellen Rowe’s All About the Trio concertsor add Ellen Rowe’s Annual Mother’s Day concert for all 5 concerts\, and get 10% off the total cost! \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				This 3rd installment of Ellen Rowe’s All About the Trio series explores American jazz pianist and composer\, Dave Brubeck\, best known for his innovative work in jazz\, particularly his pioneering use of unusual time signatures and his contributions to the “cool jazz” movement.  The trio will discuss Brubeck’s life and musical innovations\, performing both beloved and lesser known Brubeck compositions.  Audience questions are welcome! \nJoin us for an enjoyable\, informative and interactive afternoon of jazz in the House! \nEllen Rowe\, pianoPaul Keller\, bassPete Siers\, drums \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				This concert is generously supported by a collective of All About the Trio Series Sponsors: Ron & Mimi Bogdasarian\, Susan & Oliver Cameron\, Barbara J. Kelly\, Elizabeth Kirksey in memory of Web Kirksey\, and Patricia Hogberg in honor of David Hogberg\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Ticket Pricing:\n Tier 1: $40 (*Student/Youth $30)\n Tier 2: $35 (*Student/Youth $25)\n Tier 3: $30 (*Student/Youth $20)\n			\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Artists:\n			\n					\n					\n					\n					\n					\n					\n						\n			\n\n				\n														\n													Ellen Rowe\n											\n				\n					piano \n			\n			\n				\n	\n	\n\n					\n					 \n				\n					\n					\n					\n					\n					\n					\n						\n			\n\n				\n														\n													Paul Keller\n											\n				\n					bass \n			\n			\n				\n			\n\n				\n														\n													Pete Siers\n											\n				\n					drums
URL:https://kerrytownconcerthouse.com/event/ellen-rowes-all-about-the-trio-back-to-basics-the-trio-explains-all/
LOCATION:Kerrytown Concert House\, 415 N. 4th Avenue\, Ann Arbor\, MI\, 48104\, United States
CATEGORIES:Jazz Listening Room
