SUMMARY:Artist Reception: Kelley Kozloff\, painter - Soft\, at the edges
DESCRIPTION:The Janzen Boys\n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Exhibit showing: February 17th – March 29th\, 2026Artist reception: Thursday\, March 26th from 5-7 PM\nReception & exhibit are free and open to the public.Exhibit may be viewed before and after concerts and by appointment(734) 769-2999 or kch@kerrytownconcerthouse.com \n  \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				Exhibit description:A collection of abstract landscape and seascape oil and cold wax paintings by Ann Arbor artist Kelley Kozloff. Her multi-layer artwork puts imagined horizons in soft focus over underlying complexity. \nArtist statement:My art evokes the peace of mind that I experience when viewing a large body of water or a landscape that is simply earth and sky. My paintings are abstract creations from my imagination intended to lead the viewer to their own place of peace. \nArtist Bio:Kelley Kozloff is a painter based in Ann Arbor\, MI. She paints with oils and cold wax medium on canvas or wood to create multi-layered and textured pieces.Following years in careers in occupational therapy and non-profit management\, Kelley began painting with oils and cold wax medium in the fall of 2021. She loves the kinesthetic experience of creating her work and the personal connections she has developed as an artist with collectors and fellow artists. \nKelley was selected as an Emerging Artist at the 2023 Ann Arbor Summer Art Fair and has continued to show at juried art fairs since\, including the 2025 Spring One of Kind in Chicago and the 2025 Ann Arbor Summer Art Fair. \nIn 2024\, Kelley had her first solo exhibition\, Infinite horizons\, at The Common Cup in Ann Arbor\, Michigan. This was quickly followed with a January/February 2025 solo exhibition at the Chris Nordin Studios-Gallery. In May 2025\, Kelley was chosen as the first artist for a three month solo exhibit through the Gutman Gallery at Bamboo for the summer. \nhttps://www.kelleykozloff.com/https://www.instagram.com/kelleykoz_art/ \n  \n			\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				SAMPLES FROM THE GALLERY
URL:https://kerrytownconcerthouse.com/event/artist-reception-kelley-kozloff-painter-soft-at-the-edges/
LOCATION:Kerrytown Concert House\, 415 N. 4th Avenue\, Ann Arbor\, MI\, 48104\, United States
CATEGORIES:Visual Arts
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://kerrytownconcerthouse.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/Kelley-Kozloff-painter-Soft-at-the-edges.png
